{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"The auto-commit sweeper (frictionless git; normally fired by its 5-minute timer): for every registry entry flagged autocommit, stage everything and commit when the working tree is dirty - \"tracks changes in git but doesn't complain if nothing ever merges\" made mechanical. Local history only: never fetches, never pushes; a clean tree, a git-less box, or an absent registry is a free no-op. Canon/overlay repos are swept only when the owner explicitly flags them (set_repo defaults them off). Returns {swept, committed, results}.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;","params":[],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"xlqhrg1a02521633dv7","readers":[],"time":1787329431293,"username":"system","writers":[]}